[38;5;231m⏺[39m Got it — both runtimes.

  Next, the purpose question, because it's what keeps this from ballooning. "Debug production issues" can mean anything
  from "I want a stack trace when the login call fails" to "I want a searchable event trail across sessions," and those
  are very different amounts of machinery.
